{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03501","headline":"三月曲水宴得烟字 · 王勃","name":"三月曲水宴得烟字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彭泽官初去，河阳赋始传。\n田园归旧国，诗酒间长筵。\n列室窥丹洞，分楼瞰紫烟。\n萦回亘津渡，出没控郊鄽。\n凤琴调上客，龙辔俨羣仙。\n松石偏宜古，藤萝不记年。\n重檐交密树，复磴拥危泉。\n抗石曦南岭，乘沙眇北川。\n傅岩来筑处，磻谿入钓前。\n日斜真趣远，幽思梦凉蝉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}